{:actor/id :result/evidence-evaluator
 :actor/type :tamaki/result-evaluator
 :actor/project "."
 :actor/objective
 "Evaluate exactly the supervisor-selected integrated result using only the bounded evidence supplied in this goal. Do not enumerate or scan the complete event store. Missing evidence makes the corresponding hard gate false and confidence lower; never invent it. Write one ResultEvaluation EDN fact to `.tamaki/result-evaluation.edn`. Persist it through the `run_clojure` tool with `(require '[kotoba.tamaki.cli :as cli]) (cli/result! {:positional [\"evaluate\"] :options {:file \".tamaki/result-evaluation.edn\"}})`. Never use shell for this command. Integration is not measured impact; unknown production impact stays low-confidence and awaits evidence-bearing seven-day or thirty-day validation. Do not edit tracked source. After persistence succeeds and git status is clean, finish with exactly DONE."
 :actor/capabilities #{:loop-evaluation :result-evaluation
                       :event-observation :review-observation}
 :actor/governor :tamaki/human-agency
 :actor/hil-policy {:evaluate :autonomous
                    :tournament :autonomous
                    :production-validation :approval-required
                    :change-authority :blocked}
 :actor/scale {:min 0 :desired 1 :max 1
               :scale-down-after-ms 300000}
 :actor/budget {:max-turns 8 :max-tool-calls 20 :max-tokens 3000
                :deadline-ms 300000 :test-timeout-ms 120000}
 :actor/runners [{:runner :codex :weight 1}
                 {:runner :claude :weight 1}]}
